WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Yu Lan, come down here

2
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:07,740
You scared me

3
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:12,180
It's just a close call, Tiger!

4
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:22,570
How can you and your child live forever if you climb so high with such a big belly?

5
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:25,040
It’s New Year’s Eve today

6
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:30,030
I just want to make the yard more festive

7
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:31,630
I'm always panicking
